   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "####   Moyenne heures ouverture ( avg_open_hours )"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "37486cfc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Fonction qui convertir les horaires en heures normales"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5d81d04f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def calculer_heures(value):\n",
    "    if pd.isna(value) or value == 'Closed':\n",
    "        return 0\n",
    "    start, end = value.split('-')\n",
    "    sh, sm = map(int, start.split(':'))\n",
    "    eh, em = map(int, end.split(':'))\n",
    "    start_hours = sh + sm/60\n",
    "    end_hours = eh + em/60\n",
    "\n",
    "    if end_hours < start_hours:\n",
    "        end_hours += 24\n",
    "    return end_hours - start_hours\n",
    "    "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1272fd28",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Appliquer la fonction à toutes les colonnes de jours"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 34,
   "id": "241e5ba4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "horaire_hours = cl_horaire.copy()\n",
    "day_cols = [c for c in horaire_hours.columns if c != 'restaurant_id']\n",
    "\n",
    "for day in day_cols:\n",
    "    horaire_hours[day] = horaire_hours[day].apply(calculer_heures)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "69979d68",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Calculer la moyenne d'ouverture par restaurant"
   ]
